# graphics.list — pictures (the feature graphics). Screenshots are in the
# base (vikix-screenshot); these edit and draw.
gimp                # photos and pixels: retouch, crop, layers
inkscape            # vector drawing: thumbnails, titles, diagrams, SVG
krita               # painting and drawing, with a pen tablet
darktable           # RAW photos from a camera: develop, sort, export
flameshot           # a screenshot to mark up: arrows, boxes, blur, text
